ACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\"><p style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p></span><p style=\"WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/1.5 dotum; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#22741c\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 돋움\">최근 지카 바이러스에 대한 언론 보도로 인하여 필리핀에 대해 걱정하는 경우가 있습니다.</span></font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 돋움; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; WIDOWS: 1; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\"><p style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p></span><p style=\"WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/1.5 dotum; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#22741c\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 돋움\">지카 바이러스는 임신중인 임산부가 감염되었을 경우 소두증 신생아의&nbsp;출산 가능성이 제기 될 뿐, 학생들과는 거리가 먼 이슈라고 생각해도 무방합니다.</span></font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 돋움; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; WIDOWS: 1; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -